-- =============================================================================
-- 300 more of each daily card: affirmations, quotes, tips and fun facts
-- -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- The dashboard had 40 affirmations, 30 quotes, 40 tips and 30 "Did you know"
-- facts, so a member's topic deck was often only one or two cards deep. This
-- adds 300 of each, tagged with the same topics members pick, so every common
-- topic has a week or more of its own cards. Generated from
-- data/daily-content.json by tools/daily_content_sql.py; a card whose kind and
-- body are already present is skipped.
-- =============================================================================

